    "description": "深海回响 / dsh-deepsea-echo —— 明日方舟风 DSH 启动动画：鲸鱼娘 × PRTS 终端、全息锁定与干员档案，4 套原创配乐可选，可跳过、可配置。Arknights-flavoured startup / boot / splash animation plugin for the DeepSeek Harness Web GUI."
